B.afQ=s(["Plan geziye kaydedilemedi.","The plan couldn't be saved as a trip."],t.s)
B.a7B=s(["Plandaki duraklardan hi\xe7biri art\u0131k uygun de\u011fil; gezi olu\u015fturulmad\u0131. Yumy'den yeni bir plan iste.","None of the stops in this plan is available any more; no trip was created. Ask Yumy for a new plan."],t.s)
